- **Files (2):**
  - \`ProductQuality.sysml\` — \`sha256:aaaa1111\`
  - \`ScenarioVerification.sysml\` — \`sha256:bbbb2222\`
- **Session:** sess-001
- **Archive:** arch-0042
- **Origin:** user
- **Sim dt:** 0.001 s
- **Scenario:** nominal
- **View:** Interconnection
- **Started:** 2026-04-19T14:07:28.000Z
- **Stopped:** 2026-04-19T14:07:32.000Z
- **Cases:** Brew quality — station 1, Pressure safety
- **Overrides:** ambient_c=40

## Cases

